Derived code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

shared/tsdown.client.ts and shared/web-platform.ts are copied from dsh-pet
(https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-pet), Apache License 2.0, and are used
unmodified as the DSH client-bundle build preset. The DSH plugin structure
(host routes, settings.section registration, floating root) follows the
patterns of dsh-pet.

The agent-tool registration pattern (src/server/controller/agent-tools.ts) and
the composer prompt injection with its "never overwrite the user's unsent
draft" rule (src/client/utils/composer.ts) are adapted from dsh-task-pet
(https://github.com/hherosoul/dsh-task-pet), Copyright (c) 2026 hherosoul,
